With today's iOS 27.3 beta, Apple expanded Reachability to the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a>. Reachability lets &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; users shift the content on the left or right side of the outer screen to make it easier to reach with a thumb.<br/>
<br/>
